{
    "title": "Solitaire -Klondike Card Games",
    "description": "Solitaire (also known as Klondike Solitaire or Patience) - the most popular single player card games in the world. Try best classic Solitaire game by Fantasy\u00a0Word\u00a0Games and enjoy the fun of the solitaire card games!\r\n\r\nBeautiful Designs:\r\nWe carefully designed various beautiful themes, simple animations and appropriate sound effects, for a wonderful solitary experience. If you are a fan of classic solitaire games,\u00a0you're going to love this crisp and clear solitaire game! \r\n\r\nAddictive and Challenging:\r\nCompared with other solitaire game apps, we have added 6 difficulties of Winning deals (solution ensured): Easy, Medium, Hard, Expert, Master and Grandmaster. Gameplay is very simple to start but hard to be Grandmaster. More and more players are joining us to challenge the new difficulties.\r\n\r\n [GAME HIGHLIGHTS] \r\n\u2660 Random deals or Winning deals \r\n\u2660 6 Difficulties of Winning deals\r\n\u2660 7 Kinds of Card Faces\r\n\u2660 14 Kinds of Table Backgrounds\u00a0\r\n\u2660 29 Kinds of Card Backgrounds\r\n\u2660 Standard & Las Vegas style, include Cumulative Vegas\r\n\u2660 Top 10 records & other statistics\r\n\r\n[FEATURES] \r\n\u2660\u00a0Draw 1 or 3 cards options\r\n\u2660 Portrait or landscape game mode\u00a0\r\n\u2660 Single tap or drag to move cards\r\n\u2660 Unlimited hints\u00a0\u00a0 \r\n\u2660 Unlimited Undo \r\n\u2660 Left hand mode option\r\n\u2660 Special Scoring animation\r\n\u2660 Auto-Complete option to solve game\u00a0\r\n\u2660 Play the best offline games any time & any where without wifi\r\n\r\n[How to Play Klondike Solitaire]\r\nThe opening table is composed of stock, waste pile, 4 foundation piles and 7 tableau columns. \r\n\r\nKlondike Solitaire games uses a standard 52 card deck of playing cards without jokers. The objective of the card game is to expose all cards and move them into foundation piles. These piles are built upward in suit from Aces to Kings.\r\n\r\nTableau columns are built downward (in decreasing rank, from Kings to Aces) in alternating colors (red, black). Any empty column can only be filled with a King or a pile of cards with a King at the top. Partial or complete piles can be moved from one column to another if they are built down by alternate colors and decreasing rank. Expose face-down cards in the tableau to find cards you need.\r\n\r\nTap the stock to move 1 or 3 card(s) to the waste. You can move the top card from the waste pile to any legal location in the foundation piles or tableau columns. If the stock runs out, tap its outline to deal again.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWe often miss the fun that solitaire games free brought to us in the past! Here is a chance to enjoy the card fun again! Remember to share the best classic solitaire card game free with your family and friends! Train your brain as well as killing some time with your friends and family together!\r\n\r\n\r\nThe great card games without wifi is very addictive puzzle games,  now let\u2019s download this solitaire games and play incredible solitaire FREE !\r\n\r\nIf you have any feedback, suggestions or issues, Please contact us at taolin1806@gmail.com or from within the app itself. Your feedback is important to us and we\u2019ll do our best to assist you.",
